    "intro_narrative": "You have awakened in the forgotten Sanctum of Archmage Velrys. The air hums with latent arcane energy, and the heavy stone doors have sealed themselves shut behind you. Dust motes dance in the shafts of moonlight piercing through the shattered ceiling. According to legend, the Archmage concealed his true name—a word of immense power—within the sanctum's ancient mechanisms. To escape this magical prison, you must decipher the artifacts scattered around the room and translate the final incantation. The mystical tools, runic devices, and glowing relics left behind by the mad wizard are your only hope. Unravel the threads of magic, understand the connections between these strange devices, and find the hidden truth to unlock the way out before the sanctum's defensive wards consume you entirely.",
    "narrative_style": "fantasy"
  },
